WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.157
(holiday music)

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:07.543
- Oh, it must be nice to
come home from college

00:00:07.543 --> 00:00:09.623
to see your family, eh, kiddo?

00:00:09.623 --> 00:00:11.896
- Uh, yeah it's nice.

00:00:12.127 --> 00:00:14.006
Listen, I'm only here to sleep late

00:00:14.006 --> 00:00:16.930
and have mom do my laundry, alright?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.804
- You know, this country's
going down the crapper.

00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:22.973
I was watching the news yesterday,

00:00:22.973 --> 00:00:25.183
and they got these weirdos...

00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:28.270
- Mmm, that turkey
smells good, hey grandpa?

00:00:28.685 --> 00:00:30.605
I'm changing the subject before

00:00:30.605 --> 00:00:33.186
you say something super racist.

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:35.889
- Sweetheart, did you want
to bring some leftovers home?

00:00:35.889 --> 00:00:38.572
- Oh! Sure, if you have any.

00:00:38.895 --> 00:00:41.366
Give me any food you have!

00:00:41.366 --> 00:00:43.994
I eat Hot Pockets for every meal!

00:00:44.608 --> 00:00:46.738
- So, what's new with you?

00:00:46.738 --> 00:00:48.332
Are you seeing anyone?

00:00:48.332 --> 00:00:50.138
I bet you are.

00:00:50.569 --> 00:00:52.834
- Yeah I am, she's pretty great.

00:00:53.326 --> 00:00:57.447
We've talked on OkCupid four times?

00:00:57.632 --> 00:01:00.385
- I just want to say from
the bottom of my heart

00:01:00.385 --> 00:01:03.930
I love having you here, Merry Christmas.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:07.585
Get the hell out of my house
and don't come back for a year!

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:11.404
(holiday music)

